# 🧠 MERN ThinkBoard – Notes App

Welcome to **MERN ThinkBoard** — my first full-stack notes app built with the MERN stack (MongoDB, Express, React, Node). This project helped me learn how full-stack applications work, including how to build REST APIs, connect databases, and deploy apps online.
## 🚀 Features

- 🧱 **Full-Stack App** – Built with MongoDB, Express, React, and Node.js  
- ✨ **CRUD Notes** – Create, update, and delete notes with title and description  
- ⚙️ **Rate Limiting** – Implemented using Upstash Redis to avoid spamming the API  
- 🧪 **.env Configuration** – Easy-to-use environment variables for secrets  
- 🌐 **Responsive UI** – Works on mobile, tablet, and desktop  
- 📦 **Deployment Ready** – Clean structure and ready to publish  
- 🧰 **Beginner Friendly** – Designed while learning the MERN stack step by step  

---

